      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Friendly young courier Álex drops off a parcel at the agency, asks whether he can send his actress cousin's showreel, and compliments Magüi's red dress. Just as Álex is leaving, Paquita asks him to inspect a loose wall socket behind a lamp. Listen to the Spanish first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "alex",
      "t": "Buenas tardes, Paquita. Dejo esto aquí.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Muy bien, gracias.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "alex",
      "t": "¿Me echáis una firma?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "alex",
      "t": "Oye, ¿te acuerdas que mi prima es actriz?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Me acuerdo.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "alex",
      "t": "¿Te puedo mandar su videobook?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Claro, mándamelo. Apunta el mail.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Te dejo la tarjeta.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "alex",
      "t": "Qué guapa vas, Magüi.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "alex",
      "t": "Muchas gracias, Paquita. Yo ya me voy.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
